t state senator, Clay Davis, in HBO's \"The Wire.\"","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"caption":"Credit: Getty Images - \"The Wire\" star Isiah Whitlock Jr. has died. He was 71.","captionComponent":{"text":"Credit: Getty Images - \"The Wire\" star Isiah Whitlock Jr. has died. He was 71."},"identifier":"_anf-photo-1","imageIdentifier":"a1c1d4b2069355511233230c2e66ff2e","layout":"image-content","role":"photo","type":"scalable_image"},{"components":[{"components":[{"components":[{"additions":[{"URL":"https://foxnews.onelink.me/xLDS/252usdka","analytics":{"linkType":"shopping"},"range":{"length":19,"start":0},"type":"link"}],"anchor":{"targetAnchorPosition":"center"},"identifier":"_anf-body-1","layout":"internal-body-layout","role":"body","text":"Watch Fox News Live","textStyle":"end-of-article-cts","type":"text"}],"identifier":"_anf-section-2","layout":"internal-section-layout","role":"section","style":"install-section-style-mid","type":"section"}],"identifier":"_anf-section-1","layout":"divider-divider","role":"section","type":"section"}],"identifier":"_anf-container-1","layout":"divider-divider","role":"container","style":"fw-end-of-article-style","type":"container"},{"additions":[{"URL":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DS5za6eEdp2/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==","analytics":{"linkType":"web"},"range":{"length":12,"start":13},"type":"link"}],"identifier":"_anf-body-5","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":73,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":73,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":12,"start":13},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-1"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"Liebman took to Instagram on Tuesday to honor Whitlock after his passing.","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"identifier":"_anf-body-6","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":318,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":318,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"\"It is with tremendous sadness that I share the passing of my dear friend and client Isiah Whitlock Jr. If you knew him — you loved him. A brilliant actor and even better person. May his memory forever be a blessing. Our hearts are so broken. He will be very, very missed,\" Liebman wrote alongside images of the actor.","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"additions":[{"URL":"https://www.foxnews.com/entertainment","analytics":{"linkType":"web"},"range":{"length":64,"start":0},"type":"link"}],"identifier":"_anf-body-7","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":64,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":64,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":64,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-1"},{"range":{"length":64,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-16"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"LIKE WHAT YOU’RE READING? CLICK HERE FOR MORE ENTERTAINMENT NEWS","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"identifier":"_anf-body-8","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":102,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":102,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"Whitlock also has a breakout role in \"Veep,\" starring as George Maddox, the U.S. Secretary of Defense.","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"caption":"Credit: Getty Images - Isiah Whitlock Jr. is most famously known for his role in HBO's \"The Wire.\"","captionComponent":{"text":"Credit: Getty Images - Isiah Whitlock Jr. is most famously known for his role in HBO's \"The Wire.\""},"identifier":"_anf-photo-2","imageIdentifier":"908a1d4294c98da4c5244e9df84d387e","layout":"image-content","role":"photo","type":"scalable_image"},{"identifier":"_anf-body-9","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":158,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":158,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"The actor also appeared in some of Spike Lee's movies, including \"BlacKkKlansman,\" \"Da 5 Bloods,\" \"She Hate Me,\" \"25th Hour,\" \"Red Hook Summer\" and \"Chi-Raq.\"","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"identifier":"_anf-body-10","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":217,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":217,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"In \"25th Hour,\" Whitlock introduced his iconic phrase, \"sheeeeeit,\" which was his interpretation of \"sh-t.\" His phrase became so popular, the writers on \"The Wire\" decided to incorporate it into his character's lingo.","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"additions":[{"URL":"https://www.foxnews.com/newsletters?cmpid=fnfirstnl","analytics":{"linkType":"web"},"range":{"length":54,"start":0},"type":"link"}],"identifier":"_anf-body-11","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":54,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":54,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":54,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-1"},{"range":{"length":54,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-16"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"CLICK HERE TO SIGN UP FOR THE ENTERTAINMENT NEWSLETTER","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"additions":[{"URL":"https://www.hobotrashcan.com/2008/01/17/one-on-one-with-isiah-whitlock-jr/","analytics":{"linkType":"web"},"range":{"length":15,"start":166},"type":"link"}],"identifier":"_anf-body-12","inlineTextStyles":[{"range":{"length":181,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":181,"start":0},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-10"},{"range":{"length":15,"start":166},"textStyle":"_anf-ts-1"}],"layout":"ComponentLayout-1","role":"body","text":"\"I was in, I think, Grand Central Station and far away I heard someone say it and they’d be kind of smiling,\" he said. \"I’m glad people enjoy it,\" Whitlock said in a 2008 interview.","textStyle":"paragraph-content","type":"text"},{"caption":"Credit: Getty Images - Whitlock also 